| First Buddhist Council    | Ajatashatru    |
| Buddhist monastic rules   | Vinaya Pitaka  |
| Previous births of Buddha | Jataka Tales   |
| Jain Sky-clad sect        | Digambara      |
| Jain White-clad sect      | Shvetambara    |
| Anekantavada              | Jainism        |
| Middle Path               | Buddhism       |

